; Deliberately dependency-free. `algostream.advanced_models` depends on this (Ornstein_uhlenbeck's
; path simulator), and `algostream.stochastic` depends on both — so if Rng lived alongside the
; samplers in `stochastic`, that would be a cycle. Zero deps also means the reference-vector tests
; exercise the generator in complete isolation.

(library
 (public_name algostream.rng)
 (name algostream_rng)
 (flags
  (:standard -w -69)))
